OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has asked
OL,7,Fhis Justice Secretary to "work through
OL,8,Ffurther options" to prevent the early
OL,9,Frelease of Pc Andrew Harper's killers.
OL,11,FIt comes amid increasing pressure from
OL,12,FPc Harper's family and the police not
OL,13,Fto allow Jessie Cole and Albert
OL,14,FBowers, who were sentenced to 13 years
OL,15,Ffor manslaughter, to be freed in
OL,16,FJanuary under existing plans.
OL,18,FOn Monday, Downing Street said it was
OL,19,F"not possible" to exempt "one or two
OL,20,Foffenders" convicted of manslaughter
OL,21,Ffrom the early release scheme.
OL,26,@oD@ZOUpD@PO]{D@AOU{D@NO]{D@ZOU|D@JO]
