OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FHowever, Justice Secretary Alex Norris
OL,7,Fwill now look at ways to keep "a
OL,8,Fgreater number of the the most serious
OL,9,Foffenders" behind bars.
OL,11,FA Government spokesperson said: "The
OL,12,FPrime Minister has asked the Justice
OL,13,FSecretary to work through further
OL,14,Foptions to keep a greater number of
OL,15,Fthe most serious offenders in prison,
OL,16,Fincluding the killers of Pc Harper."
OL,26,@oD@_OUqD@JO]sD@aOUxD@dO]
