OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FPc Harper was fatally injured when he
OL,7,Fgot caught in a strap attached to the
OL,8,Fback of a car and was dragged down a
OL,9,Fcountry road as the killers fled the
OL,10,Fscene of a quad bike theft in
OL,11,FSulhamstead, Berkshire, in 2019.
OL,13,FTwo out of three of Pc Harper's
OL,14,Fkillers, Cole and Bowers, are set to
OL,15,Fbe released half way through their 13-
OL,16,Fyear sentences, after being convicted
OL,17,Fof manslaughter in 2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
