OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FSome 5,000 people are expected to be
OL,7,Freleased early under sentencing
OL,8,Fchanges, down from 6,000 after some
OL,9,Fexemptions were announced as part of
OL,10,Fan urgent review of the scheme to
OL,11,Ftackle jail overcrowding.
OL,13,FExemptions were made for those
OL,14,Fconvicted of rape, serious child sex
OL,15,Foffences and grooming offences.
OL,17,FLast week, the Prime Minister said he
OL,18,Fhad "pushed to the very limits of what
OL,19,Fis possible to do without risking the
OL,20,Fprison system reaching capacity and
OL,21,Fcollapsing" by making these exemptions.
OL,26,@zD@EOU}D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
