SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FHowever, more than 880,000 people have
OL,7,Fsigned a petition calling for Pc
OL,8,FHarper's killers to remain in jail.
OL,10,FNumber 10 said on Monday that
OL,11,Fmanslaughter of an emergency worker
OL,12,Fwas "not a standalone offence" and it
OL,13,Fwas "not possible to simply exclude
OL,14,Fone or two offenders" within the wider
OL,15,Fcategory of manslaughter.
OL,26,@tD@EOUtD@^O]uD@EOUvD@UO]
