OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,FAccording to The Times, a Government
OL,7,Fsource told the newspaper: "(Burnham)
OL,8,Fhas never accepted that he would be
OL,9,Fforced to choose between perpetrators
OL,10,Fof rape, grooming and the killers of
OL,11,Fpolice officers.
OL,13,F"The public wasn't satisfied with that
OL,14,Fanswer and neither was he.
OL,16,F"He has never accepted the line that
OL,17,Fit is impossible to prevent the
OL,18,Frelease of the most serious offenders
OL,19,Fand has continued to push the system
OL,20,Fon a daily basis.
OL,26,@oD@\OUoD@]pmoD@epnuD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786411080
OL,3,CBurnham orders plans to be drawn up to
OL,4,Cstop release of Andrew Harper's killers
OL,6,F"He is now increasingly confident that
OL,7,Fa solution can be found to prevent the
OL,8,Frelease of the killers of Pc Harper.
OL,10,F"He has asked the Justice Secretary to
OL,11,Fpresent a plan to Parliament that
OL,12,Fkeeps a greater number of the most
OL,13,Fserious offenders in prison, including
OL,14,Fthe killers of Pc Harper."
OL,16,FThe early release changes were part of
OL,17,Fthe Sentencing Act passed earlier this
OL,18,Fyear that cut the minimum amount of
OL,19,Ftime many offenders would have to
OL,20,Fspend in prison.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@ZO]
